  "details": "The difference between Green and Blue right now is so minimal. I'd love to see a chart showing what Statuses are used by Users cause I feel like it's just Blue or Orange. \n\nI'd love to see Green have a slight change where it still shows your location but also requires a request to join still. Then it's perfectly in the middle of what Blue and Orange provide.\n\nAlternatively, this could be a new Status option. I just feel Green is so useless right now.",
